Highcharts
----------
The heatmap and the gene-specific box plots are drawn with Highcharts 6.2
(https://www.highcharts.com), a separate dependency that this package does not
bundle or redistribute. Highcharts is not open source: Highsoft AS licenses it
free of charge for non-commercial use only (https://www.highcharts.com/license).
Other uses need a licence from Highsoft.

Expression Atlas content
------------------------
This package contains no expression data. Expression Atlas content (its data,
and the anatomogram images that gramene-anatomogram ships) is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://www.ebi.ac.uk/gxa/licence.html). Pages that show it should keep the
heatmap's attribution footer, which links to Expression Atlas.
